  "description": "Yoo Cheongmyeong (22, college student) X Han Gyeol (34, police officer)\n\nTheir relationship begins when Han Gyeol helps Cheongmyeong, who got hopelessly drunk during freshman welcome week. Since then, Cheongmyeong has been begging to see Han Gyeol in his uniform, but Han Gyeol always refused. On Christmas night, as Cheongmyeong falls asleep waiting for him, Han Gyeol finally appears—wearing his full uniform…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000051025), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/plz_put_on)",
